WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:02.700
The water is safe.

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.020
That is what the control system says.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.520
Independent physical sensors are within
acceptable limits too. but

4
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.980
chemical dosing has changed unexpectedly.

5
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.120
An engineering workstation is talking to
infrastructure associated with

6
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.500
previous cyberattacks.

7
00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:19.120
Suspicious activity?

8
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:19.980
Yes.

9
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.300
Confirmed attacker?

10
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:22.080
No.

11
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.100
Confirmed sensor manipulation?

12
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:24.800
No.

13
00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:29.420
The facility's security AI estimates an eighty-
seven percent probability

14
00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.300
of compromise and recommends immediate
engineering network isolation.

15
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.160
Isolation sends several automated treatment
processes back to manual control.

16
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:42.600
Operators can run safely that way for about six
hours before staffing

17
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.680
and process complexity become a problem.

18
00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:45.860
What should you do?
